Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从小个子就很高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝会时总是排在最后面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我却偏偏叫小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是抱歉 我不是叫大泉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这么奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢 初中部从明天起放暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家一定要注意保重身体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是三年级生正处于升学准备阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望大家不要伤风感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一二年级生将会举行…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了！召唤兽都被灭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（高一的夏天！一定要交上男朋友！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为打游戏熬夜了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:19.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个假小子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站着都能睡觉 你以为你是长颈鹿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我的前世就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:24.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！既然这么有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为处罚明天开始你也要来学校
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧 明天开始是暑假诶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须参加暑期辅导
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反对无效 好了 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,个子高真是没什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管做什么都很引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在刺激我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 听说你在篮球部很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真了不起啊 小谷先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是大谷！呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:02:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开 女巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师 我拿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你那么亲切 你还叫我女巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:06.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你巨神兵也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了！矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 找死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9}（注："ALL阪神·巨人"是日本有名的多口相声搞笑二人组）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 那边的“ALL阪神·巨人”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:11.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喊谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要那样叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“ALL 阪神·巨人”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是中野老师在入学当天给我们取的外号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有谁愿意做班级委员的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 那边的“ALL 阪神·巨人”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就由小泉和大谷来担当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:34.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呀真是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么啊 让我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开 女巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是 矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 打情骂俏到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是打情骂俏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暑期辅导可真累人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信期中考不及格 没办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲爱的要来学校参加篮球部练习 正好一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尾啊 真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是有个男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 至少有个喜欢的人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能有点干劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 我最好奇的是田春居然也来参加自习
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是年级第一名 深谋远虑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不希望离开好朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 暑期辅导是跟别的班一起上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能碰上个好男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要不碰到大谷那个矮冬瓜就是身处天堂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:37.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还想问你咧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我怎么忘了大谷是个大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有资格说别人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在会上打呼才被叫来上课的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有什么好骄傲的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比考不及格的人好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打呼的人才差劲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 “ALL阪神·巨人”暑期也在说相声啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了不要那样叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信 我要换座位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 这么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐男生的旁边啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 太勉强了吧 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厄…厄运啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个灾难的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能碰上个好男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 铃木啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没点名 不算你迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先从1班开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饭田
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上野
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远藤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大町
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我能坐在你后面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 好 请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐在小泉后面会看不到黑板的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真罗嗦 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起啊 我长得太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 反正我看得见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢他 也许这是个最棒的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎她怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 这位大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事找你 一块回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不良小鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.51,0:06:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么放学后还要跟你一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有些重要的的话不方便在学校里讲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 喜欢铃木这一型吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你你你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一看就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会被看穿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为就写在你脸上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9}（对铃木一见钟情）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想威胁我要钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能 我人最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚好想和铃木同学交个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定能帮到你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Yes I do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来大谷是个善良的家伙呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在才发现啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:24.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是 在前世一定是长颈鹿和猎人的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么麒麟？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 这个暂且放一边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 今天姐姐我请客
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃大汉堡？鱼堡？还是超值套餐？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超值套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有…田中同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田中千春！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到你会喜欢千春那型啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 她超可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 同为女孩子的我也觉得千春很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说小个子就是喜欢小个子型的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上有个不好的消息要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千春 讨厌男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消息可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌男孩子算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会治好她的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会好好期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 现在我充满了动力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你好好努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人 店内禁止拳击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游泳？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 跟我们一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:28.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真期待呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的一些朋友也会来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你交个朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 游泳了~
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是游泳么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年没来游泳了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:53.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然跟学校的泳池不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 现在不是玩乐的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不也玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 高兴到忘记正经事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 去那边游泳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像不太想来是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想来 我就不会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你们让我觉得很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学是因为考试不及格才来参加暑期辅导的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 因为考试那天我感冒请假
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要说点什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点 继续找话题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我不知道该说什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩得开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们四个人一起玩沙滩排球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个人呆呆地漂在水面上好玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不知道该说什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是最会装老实的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你平常一样就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:15.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛的诶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 中尾和小信去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们刚刚去玩那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滑水道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滑水…道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:10:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学 要不要一起去\N田中同学 要不要一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕玩那个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:03.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能不能去玩一会会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呀 滑水道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:20.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太幸运了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在游泳池边跑步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又异口同声了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？铃木同学呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道啊 他刚才就不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:46.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来找你们时 他一个人不知道去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢下我一个人去玩 我可不干
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:11:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我口渴 去买果汁了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也给大家买了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是雪中送炭啊 铃木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田中同学的我买了热的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉你身体发冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.91,0:12:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 要不要给你换热饮？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个你玩了好几次了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒 非常好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那待会我也去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:34.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 去吧去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像平常一样聊天 感觉真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:40.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又晒黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厉害吧 马上就黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然真能治好千春的男性恐惧症
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙还蛮厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:53.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.35,0:12:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:12:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千春和铃木同方向啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 铃木人不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千春的男性恐惧症也被我治好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在跟我感情好着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你们在一起的感觉好好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉也不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 托大谷的福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 明天开始也要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 让我们一起抓住幸福吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 是怎么回事呢 这种不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学 人真不错喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不是啦 我不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哟 挺机灵的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他昨天还送我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送你回家？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本以为男孩子都很粗鲁恐怖的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是铃木同学很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你昨天不是和大谷聊得很开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信说得好 大谷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对哦 大谷？我和他很聊得来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概因为他个子小 不觉得他是男生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 彻底失败…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悲惨 要是大谷听到的话 会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早 大谷同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 田中同学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你真是个有趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是大谷 我这么矮 应该是小谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作点 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮我告诉老师小谷今天要请假
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:14:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小…小谷！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:09.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都叫我小谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你要安慰我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 我在担心你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:21.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闹什么别扭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闹别扭又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人说你个子小又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是男生诶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是就因为个子小 别人不当我是男生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,个子高也好 个子小也好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有OX就是男的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}为了建设和谐社会需要特此隐去2字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子别把那个说出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在你已经被多少人说了个子小
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过被女孩子说一次有什么丢脸的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点小事就感到沮丧 你有什么资格喜欢别人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这一重拳还真打醒了我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.43,0:16:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早 现在已经是上课时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏天的早上总是爬不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冬天的早上也爬不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天约我 谢谢你们 很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 嗯 别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我长得很恐怖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天田中同学好像很怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃木同学是个不错的人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.29,0:16:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子本来就很害怕男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不是铃木同学的错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不太习惯和女生说话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 不过 和小泉同学很聊得来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是因为你和我差不多高
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没觉得你是女孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻底失败
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来田中同学并不是特别讨厌我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是喜欢千春吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不是 你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 热 是因为太热了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是喜欢她啦 太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大泉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚还在教训人的你怎么变得这么沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 当我刚刚什么都没说过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是觉得很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,平常我不会太在意的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是没想到被喜欢的人这么说 心好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是刚刚的回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,\N我是不会放弃千春的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我会继续加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点小事就感到沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么资格喜欢人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我爷爷的遗言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉能在我身边真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是只有我一个人 一定会在那里自怨自艾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.03,0:18:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏日祭典到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我邀请了铃木同学 大谷和千春
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么穿浴衣增添女人味战略
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不适合高个子的我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 千春他们还没来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电车也这么拥挤 他们该不会迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪吗？ 我穿这样很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 你很精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 铃木同学也一起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们半路遇到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和风吹拂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不让别人撞到她 他才换到人多的一边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真搞不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然搞不明白 但他真是不错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好般配啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像刚交往的情侣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:41.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说相声要知道该何时退场
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:20:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让他们两个人走下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？理莎？大谷同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 又破了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 干得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒 NICE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大谷 这次…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？大谷 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个子小 还以为被人群淹没了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想吵架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是什么态度 感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃乌贼去 烤乌贼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷虽然个子小
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他的手的确是男生的手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然总是吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们却有很多相同之处
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:54.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们都为身高感到自卑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你 请和我交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久之后 千春和铃木同学顺利交往了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于松了口气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和千春的进展真不顺利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉和铃木同学不也没有成功
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持着这份心情 我很快就会交到女朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛？拭目以待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们决一胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看谁先交到男朋友/N看谁先交到女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我赢了要怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢的游戏请到你玩腻为止
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是我赢的话 你得给我买双新的篮球鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶 之前的女朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为大谷的错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.69,0:23:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恋爱情结 love·com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和过去女友的三角关系！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得看哦
